  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Identify B formed in the reaction.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Cl</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mi>Cl</mi><mover><mo>→</mo><mrow><mi>excess</mi><mo> </mo><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mover><mo>→</mo><mi>NaOH</mi></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>NaCl</mi></math></p>",
